に頑張っていこうね🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、太鼓の達人しに行こうね🥁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岸くんの周りには沢山の仲間がいるからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/images/14/32a/c28a64d109acaf66da32bb33513d7.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"official"}}